! Submasters
! $$InhibSubm     Submaster is inhibitive
! $$EffectSub     Submaster is effect mode
! $$Dwell         Dwell time
!                 Dwell type (0=timed, 1=manual, 2=hold)
! $$LTP           LTP, default=HTP
! $$Independent
! $$Exclusive
! $$IntensityMaster
! $$Master        Slider mode, see comment, default=Master
! $$UnmarkZero    default=Off
! $$Phantom       default=Off
! $$Restore       1=Minimum, default=Background
! $$Priority      Foreground/Background, default=4/4
! $$Stomp         see comment
! $$Exclude       see comment
! $$FXOffZero     0=Off, default=On
! $$Control       number, fader mode, min, max, buttons 1-3 id/arg
 
Sub 1 1
   Text Hoose
   $$Exclusive 
   Up 0
   Down 0
   $$Dwell 0 1
   $$Exclude 1 ! Record
   Chan  151@Hff
   $$Param  151 1@255 
 
Sub 2 1
   Text Workers
   $$Exclusive 
   Up 0
   Down 0
   $$Dwell 0 1
   $$Exclude 1 ! Record
   Chan  154@Hff
   $$Param  154 1@255 
 
Sub 3 1
   Text Stars
   Up 0
   Down 0
   $$Dwell 0 1
   Chan  503@Hff
   $$Param  503 1@255 
 
